@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api

### Resolve WORK_ORDER relations
### Expected: WORK_ORDER_ASSET_RELATION found
GET {{baseUrl}}/relations/WORK_ORDER
x-tenant-id: demo
x-domain-code: DEFAULT
x-application-code: ASSET_MAINTENANCE
x-user-id: admin

### Validate invalid relation metadata
### Expected: valid false with RELATION_FIELD_NOT_FOUND
POST {{baseUrl}}/metadata/validate
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "tenantId": "demo",
    "domainCode": "DEFAULT",
    "applicationCode": "TEST",
    "type": "ENTITY",
    "code": "SOURCE",
    "name": "Source",
    "version": 1,
    "enabled": true,
    "definition": {
      "code": "SOURCE",
      "name": "Source",
      "type": "DOCUMENT",
