### Simulate WORK_ORDER START with relation prediction
### Expected: predicted.relations contains WORK_ORDER_ASSET_RELATION
POST {{baseUrl}}/simulation/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": "demo",
  "domainCode": "DEFAULT",
  "applicationCode": "ASSET_MAINTENANCE",
  "entityCode": "WORK_ORDER",
  "actionCode": "START",
  "currentState": "OPEN",
  "permissions": ["WORK_ORDER.START"],
  "payload": {
    "assignedTo": "tech01"
  },
  "mockDocument": {
    "data": {
      "title": "Inspect CNC machine",
      "assetId": "asset-001"
    }
  }
}
